From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Umair Ahmed Shah <umairahmedshah@hotmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] smarc-rzv2l: enable CONFIG_CMD_PART

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [board-specific configuration]

RAUC boot flow uses the `part` command to resolve PARTUUID and build
bootargs. Enable CONFIG_CMD_PART so `part uuid` is available at runtime.

Signed-off-by: Umair Ahmed Shah <umairahmedshah@hotmail.com>
---
 configs/smarc-rzv2l_defconfig | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/configs/smarc-rzv2l_defconfig b/configs/smarc-rzv2l_defconfig
index 26ee4ab1a3..f670350bc5 100644
--- a/configs/smarc-rzv2l_defconfig
+++ b/configs/smarc-rzv2l_defconfig
@@ -22,6 +22,7 @@ CONFIG_HUSH_PARSER=y
 CONFIG_CMD_BOOTZ=y
 CONFIG_CMD_GPIO=y
 CONFIG_CMD_I2C=y
+CONFIG_CMD_PART=y
 CONFIG_CMD_MMC=y
 CONFIG_CMD_PCI=y
 CONFIG_CMD_USB=y
-- 
2.43.0
